$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=vebkz2b  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for vebkz (gluing): the greedy assignment on ( 1 ... K ) together with the leftover map on ( K + 1 ) ... M is a nowhere-zero function on ( 1 ... M ) agreeing with every character at some position.

